# Calcx-Pro Environment Configuration Example
#
# Calcx-Pro is an entirely client-side Progressive Web Application.
# All calculations, mathematical parsing, history management, memory registers,
# and preferences are executed locally in the browser runtime.
#
# No secret keys, API credentials, or backend endpoints are required for production.

# Optional: Base public path for static hosting (e.g. GitHub Pages: /Calcx-Pro/)
# Default is "/"
# VITE_BASE_URL=/
